## Import

Import a secret as `<client_id>/<secret_id>`:

{{ tffile "examples/resources/pocketid_client_secret/import.tf" }}

Pocket ID returns a secret's value only when the secret is created, so `secret`
is null after an import, and so is `secret_wo_version`: a configuration that
sets `secret_wo_version` plans a replacement after the import, because the
provider cannot tell whether the imported secret holds the value of
`secret_wo`.

Do not import the secret a `pocketid_client` holds itself (its
`client_secret_id`): both resources would then manage it, and destroying this
one would revoke it.
